{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29309","headline":"重过圣女祠 · 李商隐","name":"重过圣女祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白石岩扉碧藓滋，上清沦谪得归迟。\n一春梦雨常飘瓦，尽日灵风不满旗。\n萼绿华来无定所，杜兰香去未移时。\n玉郎会此通仙籍，忆向天阶问紫芝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}